  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-6eff98d7f9cff8739eb4e048",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "对于具有多个幅值等于 1 或 -180° 穿越的复杂系统，基于简单伯德图的稳定性判据不够明确。必须确定可能的 GM 和 PM 值，然后借助奈奎斯特稳定判据进行深入分析并获得正确的稳定裕度。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "For complicated systems with multiple magnitude=1 or -180° crossovers, the stability criteria from simple Bode plots are less clear. One must determine possible GM and PM values and then revert to the Nyquist stability criterion for in-depth understanding and correct stability margins.",
